Error [E0356]: `.new(...)` needs one known receiver type here
  --> tests/ui/inferred_new_ambiguous.jet:17:21
    |
 17 | fn run() { item :: .new(1) }
    |                     ^^^
 Why: The inferred constructor uses the surrounding expected type; Jet does not search a global constructor registry
 Fix: Write the full `Type.new(...)` form, or use `.new(...)` where its type is already expected
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0356
